## Purpose

Take the deliberately paused handoff to its documented terminal state:

```text
exact pinned flake
→ current minimal Nix closure
→ same-path offline rebuild
→ final closure/version/dependency gates
→ canonical hq-vim conformance
→ fresh Herdr PTY
→ all three native popup journeys
→ exactly two Herdr panes
→ real Vim → yegappan/lsp → HQ submit
→ exactly one managed hq-worker run
→ accepted → started → stdout → completed
→ typed worker stop and session cleanup
→ Docker archive + OCI projection
→ OCI runtime replay in CI
→ downloadable WSLC test pack
→ final Git bundles only after completion is proven
```

